      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop running the program... that's a heavy thing to say. do you mean like, just taking a break? or are you saying that when things get this broken, the only way to fix the error is to just... exit the whole thing? it feels like the only way to stop the lagging and the weirdness is to just shut down for good.",
